#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:2
msgid "Host-VM Groups"
msgstr "Host-VM Grupos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:7
msgid ""
"Host-VM Groups define affinity and anti-affinity rules that control the "
"placement of virtual machines on specific hosts within a cloud or "
"cluster. These groups allow administrators to:"
msgstr ""
"Host-VM Grupos define affinity y anti-affinity reglas ese control el "
"placement de virtual machines en específico hosts dentro de un cloud o "
"cluster. Estos groups permitir administrators a:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:9
msgid "Pin VMs to specific hosts (affinity)"
msgstr "Pin VMs a específico hosts (affinity)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:10
msgid "Prevent VMs from running on the same host (anti-affinity)"
msgstr "Prevent VMs desde ejecutando en el mismo host (anti-affinity)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:11
msgid "Group hosts and VMs for licensing, compliance, or performance requirements"
msgstr "Grupo hosts y VMs para licensing, compliance, o rendimiento requisitos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:13
msgid ""
"Host-VM Groups can be configured at the Cloud level or the Cluster "
"(Server Group) level."
msgstr ""
"Host-VM Grupos se puede configurar en el Nube nivel o el Clúster "
"(Servidor Grupo) nivel."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:16
msgid "Role Requirements"
msgstr "Role Requirements"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:18
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Clouds`` or ``Infrastructure: Clusters`` role "
"permission at **Full** or **Group** access is required to create, edit, "
"or delete Host-VM Groups."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Clouds`` o ``Infrastructure: Clusters`` permiso de rol "
"en **Full** o **Grupo** acceso es requerido a crear, editar, o eliminar "
"Host-VM Grupos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:19
msgid "**Read** access allows viewing Host-VM Groups only."
msgstr "**Read** acceso permite viewing Host-VM Grupos solo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:22
msgid "Viewing Host-VM Groups"
msgstr "Viewing Host-VM Grupos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:24
msgid "From a Cloud:"
msgstr "Desde un Nube:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:26
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clouds``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clouds``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:27
msgid "Click the name of a Cloud"
msgstr "Click el nombre de un Nube"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:28
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:34
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:42
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:71
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:80
msgid "Select the **HOST-VM GROUPS** tab"
msgstr "Seleccionar el **HOST-VM GROUPS** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:30
msgid "From a Cluster:"
msgstr "Desde un Clúster:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:32
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clusters``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:33
msgid "Click the name of a Cluster"
msgstr "Click el nombre de un Clúster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:36
msgid ""
"The list displays all configured Host-VM Groups with their name, type, "
"and member count."
msgstr ""
"El lista muestra todos configurado Host-VM Grupos con su nombre, tipo, y "
"miembro cantidad."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:39
msgid "Creating a Host-VM Group"
msgstr "Creating un Host-VM Grupo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:41
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:70
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:79
msgid "Navigate to the Cloud or Cluster detail page"
msgstr "Navegue un el Cloud o Cluster detail página"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:43
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:44
msgid "Configure the following fields:"
msgstr "Configure lo siguiente campos:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:46
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:47
msgid "A descriptive name for the group."
msgstr "Un descriptive nombre para el group."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:48
msgid "TYPE"
msgstr "TYPE"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:49
msgid "The group type determines the placement behavior:"
msgstr "El group tipo determines el placement behavior:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Affinity** — VMs in this group should run on the specified hosts. Use "
"for workloads that need to be co-located."
msgstr ""
"**Affinity** — VMs en este group debería ejecutar en el specified hosts. "
"Usar para cargas de trabajo ese necesita a be co-located."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Anti-Affinity** — VMs in this group should NOT run on the same host. "
"Use for high-availability configurations."
msgstr ""
"**Anti-Affinity** — VMs en este group debería NOT ejecutar en el mismo "
"host. Usar para alto-disponibilidad configurations."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Site Group** — (Cluster-level only) Groups hosts and VMs by "
"site/location."
msgstr ""
"**Site Grupo** — (Clúster-nivel solo) Grupos hosts y VMs por "
"site/location."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:55
msgid "RESOURCE POOL"
msgstr "RESOURCE POOL"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:56
msgid "(Cloud-level groups) Select the resource pool that this group applies to."
msgstr "(Nube-nivel groups) Seleccionar el recurso pool ese este group applies a."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:57
msgid "SERVERS"
msgstr "SERVERS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:58
msgid ""
"Select the hosts (hypervisor servers) that are members of this group. "
"Multiple hosts can be selected."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el hosts (hypervisor servidores) ese son miembros de este "
"group. Múltiples hosts se puede seleccionar."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:59
msgid "TENANT PERMISSIONS"
msgstr "TENANT PERMISSIONS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:60
msgid "Control which tenants can see and use this Host-VM Group:"
msgstr "Control cual tenants puede ver y usar este Host-VM Grupo:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:62
msgid "**Public** — Visible to all tenants"
msgstr "**Public** — Visible a todos tenants"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:63
msgid "**Private** — Visible only to selected tenants"
msgstr "**Private** — Visible solo a seleccionado tenants"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:65
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:74
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CAMBIOS`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:68
msgid "Editing a Host-VM Group"
msgstr "Editing un Host-VM Grupo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:72
msgid "Click the edit icon next to the group"
msgstr "Click el editar ícono siguiente al group"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:73
msgid "Modify the desired fields (name, servers, permissions)"
msgstr "Modify el desired campos (nombre, servidores, permisos)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:77
msgid "Deleting a Host-VM Group"
msgstr "Deleting un Host-VM Grupo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:81
msgid "Click the delete icon next to the group"
msgstr "Click el eliminar ícono siguiente al group"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:82
msgid "Confirm the deletion in the prompt"
msgstr "Confirmar el deletion en el prompt"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:84
msgid "Warning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:84
msgid ""
"Deleting a Host-VM Group removes the affinity/anti-affinity constraint. "
"Existing VMs will not be automatically migrated but future placement "
"decisions will no longer consider the deleted rule."
msgstr ""
"Deleting un Host-VM Grupo elimina el affinity/anti-affinity constraint. "
"Existente VMs será no be automáticamente migrado pero future placement "
"decisions será no longer consider el eliminado regla."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:87
msgid "Use Cases"
msgstr "Usar Cases"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:89
msgid "High Availability"
msgstr "Alto Availability"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:90
msgid ""
"Create an anti-affinity group containing VMs that form an HA cluster "
"(e.g., database replicas). This ensures they are placed on different "
"hosts so that a single host failure does not take down all replicas."
msgstr ""
"Crear un anti-grupo de afinidad containing VMs ese form un HA cluster "
"(e.g., base de datos replicas). Este ensures they son placed en diferente"
" hosts así ese un single host fallo does no tomar down todos replicas."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:92
msgid "Licensing Compliance"
msgstr "Licensing Compliance"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:93
msgid ""
"Create an affinity group to ensure VMs that require specific host-level "
"licenses (e.g., Oracle, SQL Server) are placed only on properly licensed "
"hosts."
msgstr ""
"Crear un grupo de afinidad a asegurar VMs ese requerir específico host-"
"nivel licenses (e.g., Oracle, SQL Servidor) son placed solo en "
"correctamente licensed hosts."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:95
msgid "Performance Isolation"
msgstr "Performance Isolation"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:96
msgid ""
"Create affinity groups to co-locate VMs that frequently communicate with "
"each other, reducing network latency."
msgstr ""
"Crear grupos de afinidad a co-locate VMs ese frequently communicate con "
"cada otro, reducing network latencia."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:98
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups.rst:98
msgid ""
"Host-VM Groups are enforced by |morpheus| during provisioning and "
"migration operations. The underlying hypervisor's native DRS/affinity "
"rules may also apply depending on the cloud configuration."
msgstr ""
"Host-VM Grupos son enforced por |morpheus| durante provisioning y "
"migración operaciones. El underlying hypervisor's native DRS/affinity "
"reglas puede también apply dependiendo de el cloud configuración."

